    "City or region": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "城市或地区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code + URL Handler": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code + URL Handler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code reads env.TZ from ~/.claude/settings.json; restart sessions to apply. Desktop only gets a launch environment, never what Claude detects on its servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 从 ~/.claude/settings.json 读取 env.TZ，重启会话后生效。Claude Desktop 只改启动环境，影响不到 Claude 在服务器端检测到的信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code's sandbox blocks reading it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 的 sandbox 已禁止读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code's sandbox now blocks reading the Mac's time zone. Restart sessions to apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 的 sandbox 现在会禁止读取 Mac 的时区。重启会话后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Desktop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Desktop already runs with TZ=%@; brought to front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Desktop 已经以 TZ=%@ 运行，已切到前台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Desktop is running with a different or unknown time zone. CTimeZone will ask it to quit gracefully, then relaunch it with TZ=%@. Unsaved work in Claude may be affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Desktop 正以其他时区或未知时区运行。CTimeZone 会先让它正常退出，再以 TZ=%@ 重新打开。Claude 里未保存的内容可能会受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude is not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有安装 Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude is running in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 正以 %@ 运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude · preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude · 预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude's clock, not your Mac's": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给 Claude 的时钟，不动你的 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not create the launcher: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建启动器：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not open Claude": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开 Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not remove the launcher: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除启动器：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not update settings.json: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法更新 settings.json：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Development builds do not update themselves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发版不会自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Difference %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时差 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismiss": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dock Launcher": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock 启动器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag “%@” from Finder to the Dock. Spotlight and Raycast find it too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把「%@」从访达拖到 Dock。Spotlight 和 Raycast 也能搜到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Europe": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欧洲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Mac Time Zone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏 Mac 时区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Claude asks to rerun a command outside the sandbox, approving it can reveal the zone. Auto mode may approve it without asking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 Claude 申请在 sandbox 外重新执行命令，同意后它就可能查到时区。auto mode 下可能不经询问就自动同意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indian Ocean": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "印度洋"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Claude Desktop in /Applications, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请把 Claude Desktop 安装到 /Applications 后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接打开"
